Farm Godot remake (the GDScript scripts, scene definitions, and crop data
resources authored in this repository).

The visual game assets -- crop sprites, backgrounds, land/plot tiles, and
player avatars -- are derived from the upstream project
hjl-happy-farm-project (https://github.com/Hongjilin/hjl-happy-farm-project)
