verified and are NOT covered by the MIT grant above.

These assets are included here for an educational remake with attribution to
the original author. If you are the rights holder of the upstream assets and
object to their inclusion, please open an issue so they can be removed or
replaced.

Before redistributing this project or any derivative, confirm you have
the right to use the upstream artwork. The code (MIT) and the artwork
(upstream, license unverified) must be treated as independent components.
